  "project_description": "IMCE is a file manager featuring personal directories and quotas.\n\n Features \n \n Upload/delete files, resize images. \n Support for file systems: private, s3, google \n Configuration per role: file size/type, personal directories, quota \n Editor integrations: CKEditor, BUEditor , plain textareas. See README.txt for instructions. \n \n Theme/Js issues \n Enable \"Use admin theme for IMCE paths\" option under Common settings at admin/config/media/imce if you're experiencing theme issues.\n\n Credits \n IMCE logo by Nico Grienauer (Grienauer) .\n\n Back to top",
